# SKYWELL: a cloud mine stuns on touch; shot, it puffs into safe clouds.
# A bomb platform leaves a ticking mine that bursts into shots.
game skywell
wait 5
press A
cheat clear
cheat plat 0 0 0 13
cheat plat 6 96 -40 2
wait 5
cheat pos 100 -12
hold UP+B 6
wait 4
expect count_6 == 0
expect count_1 == 1
cheat clear
cheat plat 0 0 0 13
cheat plat 7 90 -40 2
cheat god
cheat pos 94 -52
wait 5
expect foe_5 == 1
wait 100
expect foe_5 == 0
